    <section class="shell section--roomy">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="num">05 / Outcomes</span>
        <div>
          <h2>What changed,<br />and how we measured.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-outcomes">
        <div class="o reveal">
          <span class="lbl">Active researchers, year one</span>
          <span class="big tabular">340</span>
          <p>Across the US, Mexico, and Europe. 92% of paid users active in week-12 cohort.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="o reveal" data-delay="1">
          <span class="lbl">Cleanup time</span>
          <span class="big tabular">&minus;58%</span>
          <p>Median time from fieldwork end to write-up published. Down from 3 hrs to ~75 min.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="o reveal" data-delay="2">
          <span class="lbl">Notes per session</span>
          <span class="big tabular">+2.4&times;</span>
          <p>Researchers captured more, faster, in the field &mdash; and more of those notes survived to the final write-up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

